四季向相關專家提出健保暫時性支付HTR計畫，推進後續收集真實世界數據。國際上，安克與 CARPL、deepc及SECTRA等醫療影像平台推動技術整合與合作洽談，期望透過平台的醫院網絡，加速產品拓展海外市場。","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["法人動向","AI/半導體","金融"],"bull":["漲停","大漲","買超","站上"],"bear":[],"score":8,"highlights":[],"keywords":["安克生醫","醫材","安克呼止偵"]},"time":"10/24 08:40"},{"id":"794eb498ce492018","source":"CMoney投資網誌","category":"台股","title":"智慧醫療出海添動能！3檔生技股法說會釋展望，安克獲美保險支付-財經焦點情報站","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxPajJyVjhNMjl5bHdrcUxXZXd4MUlWVW9uZmJBeU9NS1M5NXhyWnlJU1A2djd0bXNDRlBIamppQ2M2ODhZMWNXN1UzYnlVNWJscFN5NmFud2tIN2xyd3NxR29LRjlnQUtWS2x3MVNZaF90bmYzUkVTNG42d2VlVzh5TVdB?oc=5","published":1792584569,"summary":"智慧醫療出海添動能！3檔生技股法說會釋展望，安克獲美保險支付-財經焦點情報站 CMoney投資網誌","sentiment":0,"tags":{"topics":["法說/展望","金融","生技"],"bull":[],"bear":[],"score":0,"highlights":[],"keywords":[]},"time":"10/21 20:09"}],"fund":{"code":"4188","rev_month":"11509","rev":2257.0,"rev_mom":-5.919132972071696,"rev_yoy":-62.19430485762144,"rev_cum_yoy":-16.85322402648589,"eps_q":-0.45,"eps_year":"115","eps_season":"2","net_income":-35530.0,"pe":null,"pb":1.97,"yield":0.0,"updated":"2026-10-30 16:33"},"tdcc":{"latest":{"date":"2026-10-22","big1000":47.92,"big400":53.79,"retail":12.98,"holders":5049},"prev":{"date":"2026-10-08","big1000":47.92,"big400":54.15,"retail":13.04,"holders":5028},"d_big1000":0.0,"d_big400":-0.36,"d_retail":-0.06,"d_holders":21},"weekly":{"bars":[{"time":"2026-07-27","open":10.25,"high":10.25,"low":9.06,"close":9.45,"volume":216.177},{"time":"2026-08-03","open":9.45,"high":10.3,"low":9.45,"close":10.1,"volume":149.172},{"time":"2026-08-10","open":10.2,"high":10.2,"low":9.31,"close":10.05,"volume":121.373},{"time":"2026-08-17","open":10.3,"high":11.0,"low":9.89,"close":11.0,"volume":273.802},{"time":"2026-08-24","open":12.1,"high":17.65,"low":11.75,"close":16.15,"volume":4250.775000000001},{"time":"2026-08-31","open":14.6,"high":15.2,"low":14.0,"close":14.45,"volume":1654.407},{"time":"2026-09-07","open":14.1,"high":15.9,"low":12.8,"close":